  "content": "\n\n<p>夜幕降臨，災厄怪物自異界來襲。現在，舉起你的武器，將他們全部擊敗</p>\n<p>DC頻道：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/EVb5tPqdZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/EVb5tPqdZ</a><br>Discord 頻道：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/EVb5tPqdZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/EVb5tPqdZ</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>[Arterius]<br>墮落英雄，你可以在名為「災厄之門」的建築中找到他。<br>[亞特琉斯]<br>隕落的英雄，駐守於災厄之門，討伐所有試圖靠近災厄之門的怪物。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1362602/description_6476e7de-b9c4-40d4-9c71-1b45bc65535f.png\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1362602/description_61599207-f100-44f3-ae5f-00503c4d60a0.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1362602/description_32683d5b-7685-4e22-92b1-d1753c4daba8.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>[Scarlet Hunter]<br>猩紅獵手<br>繼承古老血統的獵人，守護著其中一塊災厄碎片，他將擊退任何圖謀不軌的掠奪者。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1362602/description_75b72630-6514-42bc-a1a9-c016efd0c8b3.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1362602/description_ffae7689-1e20-4641-be91-a6fd06ba3eeb.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>未來將加入更多BOSS......</strong></p>",
